{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1566,
  "batch_count": 1674,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "c0843a2d48250bf43b290794d39bc866bb741857",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0a1f4e14af1d42b3a361ac6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈……就这点本事还自称为师，真是个笑话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa99f89a221ad3055d1dad73136411cd947bb1ad6008940c5c263b56d0684cb8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36d01df513026641e91304f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个……软弱之徒……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "37e59bf67cc725a9651278b5edcbb935ecbb1b002c32ab148f8c94050428f67f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ec96312c36d82f2514f48fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们凭执念让其绽放的花朵，真是美丽啊。对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c176709bc5981b55ae14f488a5f2c33c8cdbc65de131abead27a9fe6739eb89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d64ed83cd41ebc470d8c03c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以此胜利为粮……去绽放出更为巨大的花朵吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "408899d6fc25ed4fd2b1944f716c7acd695e4f97fdee0678baec1a23edc2e429",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd5f78267749af79879b1523",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来交手吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4370c67e8b45309b1aa6e7975e2f2fc03cd3943e75f98c1eafbac9449008fec5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e23ea489f870ccf16e28a73",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "此时不绽放，更待何时！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d3e4e19f0ab4709fdb6e6f557b83ee3100f106a31d78fb129b86dacf8ba01eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c3abae2d3ce846839fb0e89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "去报答吧。报答让我萌芽的大恩。\r\n绝不会让这一切以一场庄周梦蝶告终——\r\n这，就是我的觉悟！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7eb262c286e35239140c307c9aa7259f576d2957454b9335569d1b9804e2b2a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:691ada285df67a96285c8f93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么——在这里也绽放一朵花吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd2e662d28e6f08575b6e9d9ad504d68701db662331f94da4edb68f873b851ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:593961ad8e949018d18e9ba5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让你见识一下吧。这通过剑舞千锤百炼而成的绽放之姿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b696777b17e4611c694558dce50587f235065570a6b172e27e72f22b1efe68f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:156bfee9494a078180f6c264",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刮目相看吧，这花儿的生存之道。",
      "source_fingerprint": "721306949ae5a5e062655d095d03040983becdfeb0f2da3edb2cd4eaa13df0db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29890d537380f82ac32f9b31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……呵。真没想到，\r\n居然会收训练员为徒。\r\n可别辜负了为师的期待啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d619b1fce9eed5243b71449138ae465f0d1c8a88477ae9f53fee09c69162222",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:103400349c6d1dacd834f4cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是有着悠久传统的制服。要带着骄傲穿戴整齐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c837d0d9beb67877c030ad1f8c205d4272a51468e9732ffe1122e7790a80e809",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4be73b97928a746557373969",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "随观看角度不同，韵味也会改变，真是套充满意趣的服装呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "daaa1bbf3f975f7a78148c6fea93dee19fcd11c9c8a0db3b4cc715149f165073",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca318cbdb73b6326b4a43fa6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真不错啊……感觉我的心中也绽放出了花朵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a157e21fd5cfa695062fd422d65913c783772447d99e4c5ce1960854e5a2c1e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d16e05c9480e191f9f6fa06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我打的蝴蝶结，可是以绝对不会松开而闻名的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f336751b2119b045430071a2ee28d110734d4518bff0d45d01d4c44fb2b8f205",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7516097b9ba8b3465e569415",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵……偶尔你也要不要试着跳一舞？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f9f6ef5227500e6c60d28897cdee435bb21c3bdee31d2661dbc350b01c54e28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f52cfbc576aa579b59788a8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每一次重新系紧腰带时，我都在叩问自己的觉悟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f5793809dc94b03f108d3a7c01046ee4baca7669134ce10ab3880650fab0759",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c9ce098263eee3875e2ecb4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "裁制得真好。做这件衣服的人手艺很高超啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e530ae20d0f4f984f8af76e8127c2aef08dd1997a55918befcd52a51b96a2b65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14107aed9405713cc8254cd3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "打算挠我痒痒吗？胆子倒是不小。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e57ec3511b7732d40692614d162a453a5bc9c7a3e01e85f894645b12df4658",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c3f9cf76950889368e6f537",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这极具气势的设计，让我对它一见钟情呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03ff5e4e7c5111a0b5151640020aa460366b72c7976bda8280d8564554575ae9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce89ef048c9c197c5f265f4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "御寒措施万无一失。不用担心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "09a81fd87fbeb94f4f69eb16842c3c77e7ee809eef8b644c49a20a3da3a1490b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68a26853158facc5c5e13556",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是有着悠久传统的制服。要带着骄傲穿戴整齐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c837d0d9beb67877c030ad1f8c205d4272a51468e9732ffe1122e7790a80e809",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3d0f770d2cb52baf49538a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "随观看角度不同，韵味也会改变，真是套充满意趣的服装呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "daaa1bbf3f975f7a78148c6fea93dee19fcd11c9c8a0db3b4cc715149f165073",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8856bd8a05a75f17acf0a6a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真不错啊……感觉我的心中也绽放出了花朵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a157e21fd5cfa695062fd422d65913c783772447d99e4c5ce1960854e5a2c1e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12794147bdc2dc394078527f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我打的蝴蝶结，可是以绝对不会松开而闻名的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f336751b2119b045430071a2ee28d110734d4518bff0d45d01d4c44fb2b8f205",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33143a35ae0ca29158a1a38d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵……偶尔你也要不要试着跳一舞？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f9f6ef5227500e6c60d28897cdee435bb21c3bdee31d2661dbc350b01c54e28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04390d5787ef79d4b4dc6ec8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每一次重新系紧腰带时，我都在叩问自己的觉悟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f5793809dc94b03f108d3a7c01046ee4baca7669134ce10ab3880650fab0759",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8dc17f3f756b0b86c43c0e65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "裁制得真好。做这件衣服的人手艺很高超啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e530ae20d0f4f984f8af76e8127c2aef08dd1997a55918befcd52a51b96a2b65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:616699f23ea3b4321b884431",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "打算挠我痒痒吗？胆子倒是不小。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e57ec3511b7732d40692614d162a453a5bc9c7a3e01e85f894645b12df4658",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3dcc2db28a698916c746e3e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f747fdfd41fdd19d5e6205e2563472ecb3e45190ea9201c283e895272ee13e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ea3517e640396b6a9106d87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安……怎么，一副没睡醒的眼神。\r\n我们的道路，可没轻松到\r\n能在梦游中前行。快点清醒过来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7342c06bedb914d39b162a861af21955987d71567c23c023ab466cda742a3b0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:611487ed217d3d3b2430a773",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『晨光熹微破晓时，淡隐星辰渐西垂。\r\n聆听风韵祝今朝』……呵。\r\n愿你也能度过美好的一天。努力吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b49bbcdedd671f7056a0f1eddc39cd75ee872d00f52e2e21b9b946401cd1208",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40b06dbc3a377bdc9daa04fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用过午餐了吗。若是因忙碌\r\n而怠慢了进食，怠惰之刃便会指向自己\r\n——哪怕吃一点也好。知道了吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21f16b449435ba077f5c16652b1567adf60211795b3c686b814a688549e1b8e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fd283f2988f2459257277c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "果然，一到中午大家\r\n眼神都变了呢。想要快点奔跑，\r\n热血沸腾了吧……我也一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "14e94d52a79ebc2ed448826a6ba943bc5ee093772ecce59858b593e82147961b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a60ee9c8e8a69d748fba14fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "工作结束了吗。……今天\r\n也做得非常出色。我脚步的轻盈\r\n就是明证。明天也期待你的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "969ef39d6b5c1997cfcdabdf228d56fbf63a77e27bd764b616b464016b8f0ece",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae0fea8c66068edfe75c8621",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……好一个良夜。这种时候\r\n就该离开书桌，好好享受一下夜色。\r\n怎样，要不要陪我喝一杯茶？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7ba856d491aee74c3036abd8bf9c97aad158567bb507f2ade2066d2091a3fcd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7d27336a1be07d7088837c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵……蝴蝶兰绽放的季节，到了呢。\r\n——那么，要送去俱乐部的那一盆，\r\n该系上什么颜色的装饰绳好呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb25c1597f13a7f46a6e5b014f1ec37d1948f8963e03fe1ca1f58bfa2753544e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa61cad9e2a0249c118ac98e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如此酷暑。即使洒水降温，\r\n也犹如杯水车薪吧。\r\n无可奈何……不如去瀑布下修行一番？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2461d6a4dcf98708d9952a95eb8ac07be49e0a169cbfcc7bcf87e7d5cbe8953",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d087643abb62a0d0e8770d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你最近，有看看外面吗。\r\n近来的秋意稍纵即逝。染色的树木、\r\n飒爽的秋风声……无一不是独一无二的珍宝。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b00f0eb9a512296a588c7d55a79e5f741391ea5e4b90ce53db44395b24661ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7664eda0a03f4cc8fc3d9afd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "若是弯腰驼背，心性也会扭曲。\r\n应如严冬下绽放的山茶花一般，\r\n不畏严寒，凛然傲立才对。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7a8cc0f4b496869a1476928ebad63db31ebd057933a54f3949b6d06f55a271b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d26af16f90c4fd35ad1bfbab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是情人节呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fb5b3a6ca3ece3de1bc1435a33d519b8fde7d47ebfe2d122efe0150dd3e033e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5804ac2f4aee17d18f74aa7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晨光的克服蔬菜料理，\r\n确实非常优秀。大家都能津津有味地吃光。\r\n……当然，白仁除外。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cfffeb881d813d3d1405cc83ae95e1b5646f29a80ab6bc7def06071479ee01d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:068d509d07f9b4c80f631c9b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为白仁时不时会缠着我要，\r\n我对做牡丹饼的手艺还是很有自信的。\r\n下次也做给你尝尝吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5b7e3c33acc40089d3fd1239699c0965645c7de9653c5993c9f1ce6f4838765",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4fbe95bbfc45d27b785d0ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "微光大人的梦话也是很大声呢。\r\n虽然时常会在半夜被吵醒……\r\n但一看到那副睡颜，就气不起来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a529789046b3a8da643d141f4a25be30c0dc30d3aa6c8bb740744e2d4060708f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:762fcb1526a18733ea3de89c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，又被吃得一干二净了吗。\r\n……不仅度量大，连胃口都\r\n是个无底洞啊……哈哈，不愧是总大将！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f3b18753f0228ba7592168702e10c0415bac399a6bf6194919b9294a29acd84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db16c5124acae92b990ac9d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟草上飞切磋，简直就像是『死斗』。\r\n即使拿的是仿造刀，不狩猎便会被狩猎。\r\n……呵，正因如此才让人心情舒畅。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa37d2dd3e0fe38c1ede8c91828115147353ae12cfe15fc91b513a12ede2dc80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebcd26194bc2f5eeef9e7c6e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和同届的大家一起穿上这套队服的那天。\r\n……那天难以言喻的高扬感，\r\n至今仍无法忘怀。那是属于我的黄金色的回忆。",
      "source_fingerprint": "44e7e693c2a271eef68f3a88820c95f777d7be7a573d903d669f7778a2068007",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a62d1c1e214963bf3e5d661",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Live也是一种修炼。只要心怀此念，\r\n做到心头灭却，无论怎样的\r\n舞蹈动作都不足为惧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3dd763184ed4efe4e1ba336a0b35453d1fc34883dddd7d2256c75e468cc655d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11af2356cd9b5d233fc03e81",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是为了在战场上保护自己的\r\n铠甲……也是狩猎他人梦想的\r\n利刃。这分量可不轻哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0bdf125604c8edf62233be377230d07df457383595e44116c5603b3c4dc3f2e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bb3efda3abc68522c17618c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "腰间的组纽吗？当然是我自己系的。\r\n也是呢……如果遇到需要盛装打扮的场合\r\n尽管说。我会为你精心着装的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f1a294d90325e506df25f280cf8fb028a175035235e79f17726a28eb7795a1a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63087b1ee328312fcf5bbefd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对身体既严苛又温柔的味道……果然，\r\n早晨还是刚志的特制饮料最棒了。\r\n……就是会让舌头稍微有点麻，这点挺难办的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "197945c085eeab9943b16591cc36a7919592d859bd276f41b9e3f2fcadb79152",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a498a8a91a251fcfc634eae4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……果然想跟青云天空下将棋的话，\r\n午休时间是不够的吗。\r\n但到了晚上也是一样……真是苦恼啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7d21131e41e753a9de9b0892af312aaf7767888cb778217eb4ce5172f798f85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3047e337fb879dfce339dc5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……那是神鹰的鸟吗？又\r\n偷跑出来让主人头疼了啊。\r\n罢了，在回宿舍前用口哨把它叫回来吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "23e937cd233e500cefffbabf37efca11ec7bff3585402de9f20611b7a4e4889e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8dec42b1c00b3eba83309403",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今早的新生，满面愁容啊。\r\n毕竟刚离开父母，也情有可原。\r\n……但一切才刚开始。将孤独化为食粮努力吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "296a8f3399c23d9c33df6cc62ec3298f5c6cde2a743dcf89e8d79ae6ba75fba2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0670640f2c9c1d26f36055c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不知哪里传来了风铃的声音。\r\n酷暑还在持续……但正因如此，\r\n若不通过眼睛和耳朵来享受这份清凉，那可就亏了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "449a1eabda703503ffc0ae234dccc77edad36c1c524771fd023c2771d5628fab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:890d7527c909d463ae8e15e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "差不多该添置新的秋装了……\r\n我看，最近就邀请光辉一起吧。拜托她\r\n用那一流的慧眼，帮我挑选几件好衣服。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e28b55368f06f4355dee90e81ea271440c4f623f4460b1831a6b5b432619eb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f48ec7772ba33fbc64e6dd23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……看到南天竹，就不禁\r\n想要堆个雪兔。也不知是谁想出来的点子，\r\n还真是可爱啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "75e4ba5f2ff00d1004edaf60abe72d3de10bb416d39999744565638361104c4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6d72696ac2466936438df15",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要开始了。\r\n到我身边来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e5e3b3ecee1c97ab7b50a447e8ddcdaa2c39c458e570663d13ef2faaa0b625b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4790ca1a749a6313e5846924",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "半吊子的修炼，\r\n只会让我的觉悟变得迟钝。\r\n记住，无需手下留情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8be25f2843683e3969d1cf14db10c66c9878be61604f9a466fe737dd5fb7b7fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddb3366b9395e185f9311170",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即便是岩地，花儿亦能绽放。\r\n既是如此，我也断无无法奔跑的道理。\r\n……来吧，出发。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfdf37451d06a9d8af790eaec1bdd4932908873c50f136915df1f3249f04ebfd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f8f54f1219c8b04e37c260f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的训练菜单也设计得十分考究。\r\n对于你的这份奉献，我也必须予以回应才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "751c8fca3784e75542060f7a9a38265001575bdb94c00c5d31efc6fefc97959b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7cd891042a5494ea7aa566c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你的眼神变得相当不错了呢。\r\n……但是，我可还没满足哦。\r\n期待你取得更大的成长。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91898fa67daf0abed9122e93b5f819ead19cecb42a10c9f891e8c9328532e943",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a5ec2492b05eea273a4fe56",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵……你今天的身板挺得格外直啊。\r\n是制定出了倾注全力的训练菜单吗？\r\n……哈哈，猜中了吧！真是可爱啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2022aa64dd8e0e36b7a382686554f41f9c0f2708412ef4c37edeeb9c26cdd308",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:182bcb2892bb3e437be086a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是你被人给笼络了去，对我而言\r\n可不是闹着玩的。……我是不是该\r\n周旋一下，免得你太引人注目？",
      "source_fingerprint": "35becd9e66ed2f40b841dae447bbc9f7b2fc019f5628f0a279c17308a27158db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:370a3f6917e34b3117494a03",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵。这不同寻常的酷暑，\r\n正好适合作为修炼之所。要是体温升得\r\n太高，就跳进大地母亲的海洋里吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3a8b95c3409a11179bdf5096e21c03d667d2bd0fca767d62374ba85347e4373",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21d7c2a2cc0dae82382bcae2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能和你一同欣赏这片花园，真是太好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e476db9c5d144da66c4c06693a53b0e080eef6b4f5754e120836710a8720b40a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c3bd8b14f010e7321309446",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "干得好。今后也要继续努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce359f24d4c483b5ac9ca258b0cb50479bb4e52689f9d28e3e1c280a29e621e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2eaf7159eca9837cc58bb0c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "发芽了吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "207eb2f40ee5988068df326f6f05c70dac8d967f2dbf9cdedbd2c94da77537c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c546aebc1fb721f352639bd3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "再让一朵花绽放吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "98202cd4230d2868230b5939a9bd788810486791dcfd40fcd4216872b3d3bc13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f05445b1f76dfb098a101be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是蝴蝶兰。让我看看你的觉悟吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf719c8eed193b63d89d2935fcaafbb6236462e1cca0a402678124b114db3a61",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0373062d787e2ac7c6f97515",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让其绽放吧。\r\n在我的花园里，那巨大的蝴蝶兰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8168ea37a2e4c3158cbbf4c0b27e6fe7a97b0e81c72771f17e9e24d964b26769",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:074c04e9f51dd10dd6344081",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请登记3名\r\n要参赛的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac0d0c7bdb8bc912dd5b808778309984eb769a4189381713312107659d67c439",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "2000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80f12ff3d086fb2dd22ecc1f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在这里，\n可以阅读\n关于赛马娘们日常的单格漫画哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "78ab21e16748f673dea2a8d3f992560a08f92b3475d4bc7d7d2962978ec06490",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "200000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd424dd5c7ed6d742135ed06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿♪\n很在意\n赛马娘们的秘密吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f0afd1e27dab806ca6a8c86e7e8005dc7037d0d0c4e2f5718778eb08110e39f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "200001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9bdd71f65bd3c05f5699013",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你与赛马娘之间的故事，\r\n很有趣呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e6f21deb8e80235b2ed682c6fc590d352fcbb251bfc01652bb4bbd988096ca8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "200002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51d07b209e9b9c59815f5a95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这些是历代评价点。\n以更高峰为目标，\n加油吧!",
      "source_fingerprint": "4632c22dee248a33cf11ee8e84de0cee57ab3eebd880acb982e7310f9e2febd7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "200003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a985b2dc3e577a7c13cd9402",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在摄影棚中，\r\n可以为赛马娘\r\n拍摄照片哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "790caeb460afbbad9487b0da303312ea441487069fb638e95f3ee76736603fb8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "200004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71dbb7e388098465c13a901a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在相册中，\r\n可以确认已经\r\n拍摄好的照片哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7971956f9509a1a8a7e0ebdcd321512c5c05f27c5cca0509ab8f805d092c12a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "200005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64e4dd9572ce32a0f4414f53",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员！\r\n你找到自己最喜欢的\r\n那一张了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3ff4c1242b775e51740c08456be38be5e232ec56a19e0051dd76715c7156b6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "200006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e9ab3a398b8e779c4c38203",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一旦决定，\r\n下次报名前将无法变更，\r\n请多加注意哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "057329e51051f938336cc8655f62ef892c344c41d138390c5563289a1f34fdf2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "2001"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
